{"id":"en_bracelet-broken-i-m-out","title":"Bracelet broken, I’m out","titleEn":"Bracelet broken, I’m out","description":"Emma's wedding is ruined when she discovers her fiancé and closest friend have betrayed her. In that same moment, her grandmother's pendant breaks apart, bringing to pass a foretold warning of peril. With guidance from her deceased grandmother, a powerful seer, Emma escapes alongside her parents, going into hiding from a sinister presence tied to the deadly Hollow Creek massacre. The curse then reaches countless people through live streams, and Emma comes to understand that the evil stems from a woman wronged and bent on revenge. After spending years concealed, she at last emerges, discovering how to live freely while confronting the past's lingering darkness and an uncertain tomorrow. Bracelet broken, I'm out can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/bracelet-broken-im-out/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/bracelet-broken-im-out/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Suspense","Thriller","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d2h44/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_bracelet-broken-i-m-out_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d2h44/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bracelet-broken-i-m-out_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d2h44/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bracelet-broken-i-m-out_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d2h44/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":fa